dshxkv-fadd:hover{background:rgba(95,75,60,.07)}',\n  // v831（用户样图）：卡片**放大**、一排最多三个；默认只看缩略图，**悬浮**才出现\"名字胶囊 + 图标脚\"\n  // v838（用户要求）：下拉出现时要有一段过渡（淡入 + 轻微下滑）\n  '@keyframes dshxkvMenuIn{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-5px)}100%{opacity:1;transform:none}}',\n  // v850（用户要求）：收起也要有过渡，别只有展开有（不然一开一关节奏不协调）。\n  //   `display:none` 是没法过渡的 ⇒ 收起时先挂 .dshxkv-rgbclosing（保持 display:block 播反向动画），\n  //   动画结束后再由 JS 摘掉这个类、真正隐藏。\n  '@keyframes dshxkvMenuOut{0%{opacity:1;transform:none}100%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px)}}',\n  '.dshxkv-framemenu.dshxkv-rgbopen{animation:dshxkvMenuIn .16s ease-out}',\n  '.dshxkv-framemenu.dshxkv-rgbclosing{display:block;animation:dshxkvMenuOut .14s ease-in forwards}',\n  '.dshxkv-fgrid{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;padding:0 6px 6px;max-width:392px}',\n  // v832（用户澄清）：卡片**高度固定不变**，悬浮只是从**上下各盖一条**（名称 / 按钮），不是把卡片撑高\n  '.dshxkv-fcard{position:relative;width:122px;height:96px;box-sizing:border-box;border:2px solid #f6c3d4;border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;background:#faf9f5}',\n  '.dshxkv-fcard:hover{border-color:#f2a9c1}',\n  '.dshxkv-fcard-on{border-color:#2b2925}',\n  // 缩略图铺满整张卡片（绝对定位 ⇒ 悬浮时覆盖上去的那两条不会挤动它）\n  '.dshxkv-fcard .dshxkv-fthumb{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:0;background:rgba(95,75,60,.06);overflow:hidden}',\n  '.dshxkv-fcard .dshxkv-fthumb svg{display:block;width:100%;height:100%}',\n  // 悬浮：顶部盖一条白底名称（盖住缩略图上沿），底部盖一条按钮栏（盖住下沿）\n  // v834（用户要求）：这两条出现的**过程也要有过渡** —— 用 opacity/visibility/transform 而不是 display 切换\n  //   （display 切换没法过渡），名称自上而下淡入、按钮栏自下而上淡入，各 .16s。\n  '.dshxkv-fcardname{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;background:#faf9f5;border-radius:0;text-align:center;font-size:11.5px;line-height:1.6;color:#2b2925;font-weight:600;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(95,75,60,.16);opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(-6px);transition:opacity .16s ease,transform .16s ease,visibility .16s ease}',\n  // 按钮**自动等间距**（space-evenly：四个按钮 + 左右边距一起均分）\n  '.dshxkv-fcardfoot{display:flex;position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;align-items:center;justify-content:space-evenly;gap:0;padding:3px 2px;background:#fbd6e2;opacity:0;visibility:hidden;transform:translateY(6px);transition:opacity .16s ease,transform .16s ease,visibility .16s ease}',\n  '.dshxkv-fcard:hover .dshxkv-fcardname,.dshxkv-fcard:hover .dshxkv-fcardfoot{opacity:1;visibility:visible;transform:none}',\n  '.dshxkv-fcard .dshxkv-facts{display:contents}',\n  '.dshxkv-fcard .dshxkv-ficonbtn{width:20px;height:20px}',\n  '.dshxkv-fcard .dshxkv-ficonbtn svg{width:15px;height:15px}',\n  // 复制出来的新卡片要有\"进场\"过渡（用户要求）；v834：时间从 .34s 收到 .2s（原来偏长）\n  '@keyframes dshxkvFcardIn{0%{opacity:0;transform:scale(.86)}60%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1.03)}100%{opacity:1;transform:none}}',\n  '.dshxkv-fcard-new{animation:dshxkvFcardIn .2s ease-out}',\n  // 触发按钮：文字居中、▾ 右对齐（用户要求）\n  '.dshxkv-framebtn{padding-right:22px !important}',\n  '.dshxkv-framebtntext{display:block;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap}',\n  '.dshxkv-framebtnarrow{position:absolute;right:8px;top:50%;transform:translateY(-50%);font-size:10px;opacity:.75}',\n  // ===== v823（P2）：泡泡框编辑器（新建/编辑/另存为）=====\n  // 层号与 .dshxkv-bubmask 同级（PLAN §9）；打开时还会走 dshxkLayerUp() 抬到父窗口之上。\n  '.dshxkv-framemask{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(20,20,19,.55);z-index:20500;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color-scheme:light}',\n  '.dshxkv-framecard{background:#faf9f5;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;width:560px;max-width:94vw;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.3);color:#2b2925;box-sizing:border-box;max-height:92vh;overflow-y:auto;overflow-x:hidden;text-align:left}',\n  '.dshxkv-fetitle{font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#2b2925;margin-bottom:6px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;justify-content:center}',\n  '.dshxkv-fename{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:12px;margin-bottom:0}',\n  '.dshxkv-feinp{flex:1;min-width:0;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid rgba(95,75,60,.4);border-radius:6px;background:#faf9f5;color:#2b2925;font-size:12px;padding:4px 8px}',\n  '.dshxkv-festagebox{border:1px dashed rgba(95,75,60,.5);border-radius:10px;background:#faf9f5;padding:8px;text-align:center}',\n  '.dshxkv-festage{position:relative;margin:0 auto;touch-action:none;user-select:none;-webkit-user-select:none}',\n  '.dshxkv-festage svg{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;width:100%;height:100%;display:block}',\n  '.dshxkv-festage .dshxkv-text{opacity:1;transition:none;pointer-events:none}',\n  // v852：`.dshxkv-fehint` 已经没有任何元素用它（那些小字提示在 v829 就删光了）⇒ 规则一并删掉\n  '.dshxkv-febody{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:flex-start;margin-top:8px;flex-wrap:wrap}',\n  '.dshxkv-feslots{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;flex:0 0 auto;min-width:88px;margin-top:10px}',\n  '.dshxkv-feslot{border:1px solid rgba(95,75,60,.4);border-radius:6px;background:#faf9f5;color:#2b2925;font-size:12px;padding:4px 8px;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;white-space:nowrap}',\n  '.dshxkv-feslot:hover{background:rgba(95,75,60,.08)}',\n  '.dshxkv-feslot.dshxkv-feslot-on{background:#d97757;color:#fff;border-color:#2b2925}',\n  '.dshxkv-feslot.dshxkv-feslot-off{opacity:.45;text-decoration:line-through}',\n  '.dshxkv-feattrs{flex:1 1 240px;min-width:200px}',\n  // v855：「内容显示范围与位移」这一栏的外壳（块级 + 满宽）以及它里面两块都撑满\n  '.dshxkv-fesafewrap{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}',\n  // v857（用户要求）：切换「SVG代码 / 图片导入」、以及「外观」这一节出现时都要有过渡\n  '@keyframes dshxkvFeIn{0%{opacity:0;transform:translateY(-4px)}100%{opacity:1;transform:none}}',\n  '.dshxkv-fefade > *{animation:dshxkvFeIn .2s ease-out both}',\n  '.dshxkv-fesafewrap > div,.dshxkv-fesafewrap .dshxkv-menu-row{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}',\n  '.dshxkv-ferow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:0 0 6px;font-size:12px;color:#2b2925;flex-wrap:wrap}',\n  // v853：标签列统一 64px —— 「文字默认色」「内容显示范围」这类长标签以前会把整行撑宽/换行，\n  //   导致同一节里各行的输入起点不齐、右侧留白忽大忽小。\n  '.dshxkv-felab{flex:0 0 64px;color:#2b2925}',\n  '.dshxkv-fenum{width:56px;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid rgba(95,75,60,.4);border-radius:6px;background:#faf9f5;color:#2b2925;font-size:12px;padding:3px 6px}',\n  '.dshxkv-fetext{width:88px;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid rgba(95,75,60,.4);border-radius:6px;background:#faf9f5;color:#2b2925;font-size:12px;padding:3px 6px}',\n  '.dshxkv-fecode{width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;border:1px solid rgba(95,75,60,.4);border-radius:6px;background:#faf9f5;color:#2b2925;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:11px;padding:4px 6px;height:64px;resize:vertical}',\n  '.dshxkv-fenote{font-size:11px;color:#a09d96;line-height:1.5;flex:1 1 100%;margin:2px 0 6px}',\n  '.dshxkv-fechip{border:1px solid rgba(95,75,60,.4);border-radius:6px;background:#faf9f5;color:#2b2925;font-size:12px;padding:3px 10px;cursor:pointer}',\n  '.dshxkv-fechip.dshxkv-fechip-on{background:#d97757;color:#fff;border-color:#2b2925}',\n  '.dshxkv-fechip-off{opacity:.4;cursor:default}',\n  '.dshxkv-febtns{display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-top:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}',\n  // v852：`.dshxkv-fesep` 也没人用了（老版编辑器里的分隔线）⇒ 删掉\n  // v837：「内容限制范围与位移」也改成 dshxkvFoldEntry + collapseSet 那一套 ⇒ 自绘的摘要行样式不再需要\n  // 跑马灯选项:文字用实际渐变色渲染,并带与泡泡同款流动动画;当前项用 ✓ 前缀标记(避免背景高亮盖掉渐变)\n  '.dshxkv-qcolmenu .dshxkv-rgbopt.optgrad{background-clip:text;-webkit-background-clip:text;color:transparent;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;text-shadow:none;background-size:200% auto;animation:dshxkvRainbow 2.6s linear infinite;transition:transform .15s ease}',\n  // 渐变选项的悬浮反馈:轻微放大+下划线(不增亮、不铺灰底,避免影响渐变可读性)\n  '.dshxkv-qcolmenu .dshxkv-rgbopt.optgrad:hover{transform:scale(1.06);transform-origin:right center;text-decoration:underline}',\n  // 快速编辑悬浮窗(文本/随机句)\n  '.dshxkv-qedit{position:fixed;z-index:26000;background:#faf9f5;border:1px solid rgba(95,75,60,.35);border-radius:10px;box-shadow:0 8px 22px rgba(20,20,19,.22);padding:10px 12px;color-scheme:light}',\n  '.dshxkv-qedit-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;margin:3px 0;flex-wrap:wr